abstract: "A curated, reproducible dataset derived from U.S. EPA Toxics Release Inventory Basic Data Files for Illinois, covering reporting years 2010 through 2024. The package includes cleaned records, derivative time-series outputs, metadata, provenance, documentation, and reproducible Python workflow scripts."
